<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="GAL" style="id" />
  <para style="h">JO GALATIA</para>
  <para style="toc1">Waraga ma Paulo ocoyo bot Jo Galatia</para>
  <para style="toc2">Jo Galatia</para>
  <para style="toc3">Gal</para>
  <para style="mt2">Waraga ma Paulo ocoyo bot</para>
  <para style="mt1">JO GALATIA</para>
  <para style="imt">Lanyut wilok madito ma i buk man</para>
  <para style="ip">Ikare ma kicako tito pi Kwena Maber ma mako kom Yecu dok bene ma jo mogo ma pe gubedo Lujudaya gucako jolone, ci dano gucako penyo kace kong myero gilub Cik pa Moses ka wek i dok lakricitayo me ada. Paulo onongo owaco ni meno pe mite, ento en owaco ni gin ma myero gutii matek me ada me bedo lakricitayo en aye bedo ki niye, pien niye aye ma weko Lubanga pwoyo dano ma ye en. Ento i kanica ma nonge i Galatia matye ite ker pa jo Roma i Acia, onongo tye jo ma okwero pwony pa Paulo woko kun gin waco ni; wek Lubanga ojoli, omyero dano ducu gulub Cik pa Moses.</para>
  <para style="ip">Waraga man ma Paulo ocoyo bot jo Galatia ni obedo pi dwoko dano ma onongo kirwenyogi woko cen i niye ki i yo me ada. Paulo ocako coyo waraga man ki nyutu twerone macalo lakwena ma Lubanga aye ma omiye twero meno kun twero meno pe owok ki bot dano, dok bene tito ni en kiore bot jo ma pe gubedo Luyudaya. Dok bene en moko telok man ni pe tye gin mapat ki niye ma weko dano nongo pwoc ki bot Lubanga. I cura mogo ma giko buk man Paulo nyutu kamaleng ni kwo pa lakricitayo bedo atir kun a ki i mar matye i niye ikom Kricito.</para>
  <para style="iot">Lacim wilok madito ma i buk man</para>
  <para style="io1">Lanyut <char style="ior"><ref loc="GAL 1:1-10">1:1-10</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Twero pa Paulo macalo lakwena <char style="ior"><ref loc="GAL 1:11-2:21">1:11—2:21</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Kwena Maber me kica pa Lubanga <char style="ior"><ref loc="GAL 3:1-4:31">3:1—4:31</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Bedo agonya ma a ki ibedo lakricitayo ki tic mamako komgi <char style="ior"><ref loc="GAL 5:1-6:10">5:1—6:10</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Ladol lok <char style="ior"><ref loc="GAL 6:11-18">6:11-18</ref> </char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="GAL 1" />
  <para style="s1">Mot</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 1:1" />Waraga man oa ki bot an Paulo ma lakwena. Pe dano mogo aye ma ceng guora, or ma mera me bedo lakwena pe yam owok ki bot dano mo, ento oa ki bot Yecu Kricito ki bot Lubanga Won ma ceng ocere woko ki ikin jo ma oto. <verse eid="GAL 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 1:2" />Utmegiwa ducu ma gitye kacel kweda kany bene gumoto wun jo ducu ma wuye Kricito ma wubedo i Galatia: <verse eid="GAL 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 1:3" />Lubanga Wonwa ki Rwotwa Yecu Kricito omiwu kica kacel ki kuc, <verse eid="GAL 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 1:4" />en Kricito mayam omine kene pi balwa wek en olarwa woko ki igin marac me kare man, kun lubu gin ma Lubanga Wonwa mito. <verse eid="GAL 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 1:5" />Deyo obed bot Lubanga nakanaka. Amen.<verse eid="GAL 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lok me Kwena Maber mo mukene peke</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 1:6" />An auru kit ma wuloke kwede oyot, kun wubwoto ngat ma ceng olwongowu i kica pa Kricito, dok wuloke woko wutye kalubu lok me kwena mo mukene. <verse eid="GAL 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 1:7" />Lok me Kwena Maber mo mukene gire peke, ento tye jo mogo ma balo cwinywu woko, kun gimito gilok lok me Kwena Maber pa Kricito odok gin mapat. <verse eid="GAL 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 1:8" />Ento kadi bed wan nyo lamalaika mo ma oa ki i polo, ce otitiwu lok me kwena mapat ki lok ma nene watito botwuni, omyero kicen woko. <verse eid="GAL 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 1:9" />Kit macalo nene watito botwu, pud dok atito ki wun aye ni, kace tye ngat mo ma dok tye katitiwu lok me kwena ma poke woko ki mayam dong wuyeni, omyero kicen woko.<verse eid="GAL 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 1:10" />Wutamo ni atye kayenyo cwak pa dano mono, nyo pa Lubanga? Gwok nyo atye kateme me yomo cwiny dano ba? Kace nene abedo kayomo cwiny dano, onongo myero pe abed latic pa Kricito.<verse eid="GAL 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kit ma Paulo odoko kwede lakwena</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 1:11" />Utmegina, amito wunge lok man ni, lok me Kwena Maber ma ceng atito botwuni pe obedo gin pa dano. <verse eid="GAL 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 1:12" />Pe yam agamo lok man me Kwena Maber ki bot dano mo, dok bene pe kipwonya kwede apwonya, ento anongo ki bot Yecu Kricito ma ceng onyute botani. <verse eid="GAL 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 1:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 8:3">Tic 8:3</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 22:4">22:4</ref>,<ref loc="ACT 22:5">5</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 26:9-11">26:9-11</ref> </char></note> Wutyeko dong winyo lok ikom kwona macon ikare ma onongo pud alubu dini pa Lujudaya, kit ma abedo kalibo kwede jo ma oye Lubanga, kun atimo bwami ikomgi, dok ateme mada me nekogi woko liweng. <verse eid="GAL 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 1:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 22:3">Tic 22:3</ref> </char></note> I dini pa Lujudaya an aye ma onongo aloyo jo mapol ma gin yalwaka ma gin jo me roka, kun aketo cwinya adada me lubu kit me tekwaro pa kwarowa. <verse eid="GAL 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 1:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 9:3-6">Tic 9:3-6</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 22:6-10">22:6-10</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 26:13-18">26:13-18</ref></char></note> Ento Lubanga yam oyera wa con, ci oketa woko pat ma onongo pud peya kinywala, ka dok olwonga gire pi kicane. <verse eid="GAL 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 1:16" />Cwinye obedo yom me nyuta Wode, wek acit atit pire bot Lurok. Ikare ma lok man otime, pe aa acito bot dano mo ni omiya tam, <verse eid="GAL 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 1:17" />dok bene pe aa acito i Jerucalem bot jo mukwongo bedo lukwena kweda, ento acito gira cen wa i Arabia, ka aa ki kunu dok adwogo cen i Damaciko.<verse eid="GAL 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 1:18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:18: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 9:26-30">Tic 9:26-30</ref> </char>
    </note> Inge mwaka adek acito i Jerucalem kalimo Kepa, ci abedo kunu pi nino apar wiye abic. <verse eid="GAL 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 1:19" />Ento ikin lukwena aneno Yakobo omin Rwot keken. <verse eid="GAL 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 1:20" />Me ada kadi wa inyim Lubanga, lok ducu ma acoyo botwu i waraga man goba pe iye. <verse eid="GAL 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 1:21" />Ka dok acito i lobo Ciria ki Cilicia, <verse eid="GAL 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 1:22" />kun onongo lwak dano mapol ma guye Kricito ma gitye ikabedo ducu i Judaya peya gingeya dok peya guneno koma. <verse eid="GAL 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 1:23" />Onongo guwinyo lok ikoma keken ma kititigi ni, “Ngat mayam obedo kayelowani, kombedi tye katito lok ikom niye man mayam kong otemo tyekone wokoni.” <verse eid="GAL 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 1:24" />Omiyo gupako Lubanga pira.<verse eid="GAL 1:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="GAL 2" />
  <para style="s1">Paulo ki Lukwena mukene</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 2:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 11:30">Tic 11:30</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 15:2">15:2</ref> </char>
    </note> Lacen inge mwaka apar wiye angwen dok acito i Jerucalem aye kacel ki Barnaba, dok bene atero Tito me wot kacel kweda. <verse eid="GAL 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 2:2" />Acito kunu pien Lubanga onongo onyuta ni omyero aciti. Ma ao kunu, ci aketo lok me Kwena Maber ma abedo katitone bot Luroki inyimgi i mung bot jo ma ngene, wek tica ma atiyo, nyo madong atyeko tiyone con, pe obed me nono. <verse eid="GAL 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 2:3" />Ento Tito ma onywako wot kweda, kadi bed onongo en Lagrik, pe kibedo kadiye ni myero kilire, <verse eid="GAL 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 2:4" />kadi bed onongo tye jo mogo ma kikelogi ikinwa ma pe gin utmego kikome, magi gin jo ma gubino karoto kit kuc ma watye kwede i Kricito Yecu, ka wek kilokwa wadok opii. <verse eid="GAL 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 2:5" />Ento pe waye lokgi, wek wagwok lok ada me Kwena Maber pirwu. <verse eid="GAL 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 2:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 10:17">Nwo 10:17</ref> </char></note> Ki tung bota pe onongo aparo pi jo ma gingene ni gin ludito, pien Lubanga gire pe lenge tung bot ngat mo pi kit ma en tye kwede. Gin jo ma ngenenu pe gumeda gin mo. <verse eid="GAL 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 2:7" />Ento guniang ni Lubanga dong omiya tic me tito lok me Kwena Maber bot Lurok, marom ki kit macalo yam kimiyo ki Petero tic me tito lok me Kwena Maber bot Lujudaya; <verse eid="GAL 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 2:8" />pien ngat ma otiyo kacel ki Petero tic me tito lok me Kwena Maber bot Lujudaya, obedo katic ikoma bene bot Lurok. <verse eid="GAL 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 2:9" />Yakobo ki Kepa ki Jon mayam kingeyogi ni gubedo lutela, ka dong guniang pi kica ma Lubanga omiya ci gugamo an ki Barnaba macalo lutic wadigi, kun gipoko tic ni wan myero wacit bot Lurok ki gin gucit bot Lujudaya. <verse eid="GAL 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 2:10" />Gin gulegowa lok acel keken ni omyero wapo pi lucan, ma man aye onongo gin ma aketo cwinya ni omyero atim.<verse eid="GAL 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Paulo ojuku Kepa i Antiokia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 2:11" />Ikare ma Kepa obino i Antiokia ajuke woko atyer kamaleng pien onongo otimo gin ma pe ber. <verse eid="GAL 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 2:12" />Pien ikare ma jo mogo ma gua ki bot Yakobo peya gubino, onongo Kepa nywako cam kacel ki Lurok; ento ikare ma gubino ci Kepa ojer onyiko woko cen, opoke woko ki botgi pi lworo dul pa jo ma mito ni jo ma oye Kricito myero kong kilirgi. <verse eid="GAL 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 2:13" />Lujudaya mukene gucako lubu kit pa Kepa me goba, kadi ki Barnaba bene ocako ngak woko kun lubu kitgi ma pe nyutu cwiny me ada. <verse eid="GAL 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 2:14" />Ento ikare ma aneno ni guweko ada me lok me Kwena Maber woko ma onongo tamgi tye kawot atata, ci apenyo Petero ki inyimgi ducu ni, “Ka in ma Lajudayani ilubu kit pa Lurok, ma pe ibedo calo Lajudaya, ci itwero diyo Lurok ningning me lubu kit pa Lujudaya?”<verse eid="GAL 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lujudaya ki Lurok ducu kilarogi pi niye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 2:15" />Wan kikomwa wan Lujudaya nia wa i anywali, pe wan Lurok, jo ma lubalogu. <verse eid="GAL 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 2:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:16: a </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 143:2">Jab 143:2</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 3:20">Rom 3:20</ref>; </char><char style="xo" closed="false">b </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 3:22">Rom 3:22</ref> </char></note> Ento wangeyo ni dano pe kikwano ni kite atir pien tiyo gin ma Cik mito, ento pi ye Yecu Kricito keken. Kadi wa wan Lujudaya bene watyeko ye Yecu Kricito wek kikwanwa ni kitwa atir pi ye Kricito, ento pe pi tiyo gin ma Cik mito; pien pe kibikwano dano moni ni kite atir pien tiyo gin ma Cik mito. <verse eid="GAL 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 2:17" />Ento kombedi, ka watye kayele ni wek kikwanwa ni kitwa atir pi Kricito, kun wan kikomwa bene watye lubalo marom aroma ki Lurok, ci Kricito mono obedo lakwena me tic pi bal? Adadaeni pe kumeno! <verse eid="GAL 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 2:18" />Ka dok agero gedo mayam amuku areto woko pinyi odoco, ci an kara latur Cik. <verse eid="GAL 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 2:19" />Pien pi temo tiyo gin ma Cik mito omiyo yam ato pi Cik, wek abed kwo tung bot Lubanga. Yam kigura ikom yatariya kacel ki Kricito; <verse eid="GAL 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 2:20" />pe dok an ma akwoni, ento Kricito aye ma bedo kwo i iya. Kwo ma kombedi atye kwede ikomani, abedo kwo pi ye Wod pa Lubanga, ma ceng omara ka omine gire pire kene pira. <verse eid="GAL 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 2:21" />An gira pe abolo kica pa Lubanga; pien ka gikwano dano ni kitgi atir pi Cik, ci Kricito yam oto nono labongo tyen lok mo.<verse eid="GAL 2:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="GAL 3" />
  <para style="s1">Lubu Cik nyo bedo ki niye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 3:1" />Wun jo Galatia kara wuming kuman! Anga ma orogowu? Wun ceng kinyutu botwu atyer kit ma kiguro kwede Yecu ikom yatariya kun wuneno ki wangwu! <verse eid="GAL 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 3:2" />Kong apenywu ki peny man keken: wun mono yam wulimo Cwiny Maleng pi lubu Cik, kece nyo pi ye lok me Kwena Maber ma wuwinyo kitito botwuni? <verse eid="GAL 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 3:3" />Wun kara luming kuman! Wucako lubu kit me Cwiny, ci kombedi dong wumito wugik ki tekomwu? <verse eid="GAL 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 3:4" />Gin jami mapol madongo macalo meno otime botwu nono? I adane onongo otime ki tyen lok! <verse eid="GAL 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 3:5" />En Lubanga ma omiyowu Cwiny Malengi, dok otiyo bene tango mapol ikinwu, wutamoni en otiyo man pien ni wulubu Cik, kece nyo pi ye kwena ma wuwinyo ma kitito botwuni?<verse eid="GAL 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 3:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 15:6">Aca 15:6</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 4:3">Rom 4:3</ref> </char>
    </note> Kitmeno bene yam kicoyo lok ikom Abraim ni, “En oye Lubanga, omiyo kikwane ni en dano ma kite atir.” <verse eid="GAL 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 3:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 4:16">Rom 4:16</ref> </char></note> Myero wunge ni jo matye ki niye, gin aye likwayo pa Abraim kikome. <verse eid="GAL 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 3:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 12:3">Aca 12:3</ref> </char></note> Lucoo ginacoya yam con onongo dong gungeyo woko ni, Lubanga bikwano Lurok ni gin jo ma kitgi atir pi niye. Lubanga yam otito lok me Kwena Maber con bot Abraim kun wace ni, “Rok ducu bilimo gum piri.” <verse eid="GAL 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 3:9" />Pimeno, jo matye ki niye gibinongo gum kacel ki Abraim ma obedo ki niye.<verse eid="GAL 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 3:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 27:26">Nwo 27:26</ref> </char>
    </note>Jo ducu ma gujenge ikom tic me lubu Cik dong kicenogi woko; pien yam kicoyo ni, “Cen opot ikom jo ducu ma pe gilubu gin ducu ma kicoyo i buk me Cik, kun kicobo bene tice kakare.” <verse eid="GAL 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 3:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HAB 2:4">Kab 2:4</ref> </char></note> Kombedi lok dong ongene woko ni, pe kikwano dano mo ni kite atir inyim Lubanga pi tiyo gin ma Cik mito; pien kicoyo ni, “Ngat ma kite atir pi niye bibedo kwo.” <verse eid="GAL 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 3:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 18:5">Lev 18:5</ref> </char></note> Ento Cik pe ocung ikom niye, pien kicoyo ni, “Ngat ma tiyo kun lubu gin ma Cik mito bikwo pire.” <verse eid="GAL 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 3:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 21:23">Nwo 21:23</ref> </char></note> Kricito aye ma nene okokowa ki i cen ma opoto ikomwa pien pe walubu Cik; en obino ci oloke odoko dano ma kiceno ma kakawa. Pien yam kicoyo ni, “Cen opoto ikom dano ma kingabo malo iwi yat.” <verse eid="GAL 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 3:14" />Lok man otime wek gum ma Lubanga ceng omiyo ki Abraim Lurok bene gunong pi Yecu Kricito, ka wek wan bene walim Cwiny Maleng mayam kiciko pireni pi niye.<verse eid="GAL 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Cik ki gicike</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 3:15" />Utmegina, kong anyut labol me lok ikom dano. Ka jo aryo gucike i gin moni, ma gumoko gicikegi, ngat mo pe dok twero lokone, dok bene pe twero medo gin mo i gicike meno. <verse eid="GAL 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 3:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 12:7">Aca 12:7</ref> </char></note> Lubanga yam ocike gin ki Abraim ki bot lakware bene. Ento yam ginacoya pe owaco ni, “Ki bot likwayi,” ma nyutu ni gipol, ento owaco ni, “Ki bot lakwaru,” ma nyutu dano acel keken, ma en aye Kricito. <verse eid="GAL 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 3:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:40">Nia 12:40</ref> </char></note> Gin ma myero alok tye kit man ni, Cik madong obino lacen inge mwaka miya angwen ki pyere adek pe dong romo turu gicike ma con Lubanga otyeko mokone wokoni, dok bene pe bimiyo gin ma ociko lal nono. <verse eid="GAL 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 3:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 4:14">Rom 4:14</ref> </char></note> Kace leyo jami ma kimiyo ki Abraim obedo pi Cik, meno nongo pe lubu kit cike mo. Ento Lubanga yam omiyo bot Abraim i gicike macalo mot.<verse eid="GAL 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 3:19" />Cik dok mite pingo? Cik yam kimedo ni wek turu Cik onen woko kamaleng, nio wang ma lakwaro Abraim ma kiketo cike pireni obino. Lumalaika aye ma ceng gukelo Cik, ci gumiyo i cing ngat ma larib dano kacel. <verse eid="GAL 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 3:20" />Ento larib dano pe mite pi ngat acel keken, ento Lubanga aye tye acel.<verse eid="GAL 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Gin ma omiyo kiketo Cik</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 3:21" />Itamo ni Cik dong tye kapyem ki gicike pa Lubanga? Pe kitmeno gire, pien ka nene kimiyo Cik matwero miyo kwo, kono kwano dano ni kite atir obedo pi lubu Cik. <verse eid="GAL 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 3:22" />Ento coc mayam kicoyo otweyo dano ducu macalo lumabuc ite twero me bal, wek cike ma nene kiciko pi ye Yecu Kricito kimii bot jo ma oye en.<verse eid="GAL 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 3:23" />Ikare ma niye peya obino, Cik aye ma onongo gwokowa, kun otweyowa woko macalo mabuc, nio ka kinyutiwa niye. <verse eid="GAL 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 3:24" />Kitmeno Cik aye obedo lagwokwa ma myero olowa nio ka Kricito obino, ka dong kicako kwanowa ni kitwa atir pi niye. <verse eid="GAL 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GAL 3:25" />Kit ma dong niye tye ni, pe dok wabedo ite twero pa lagwokwa; <verse eid="GAL 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GAL 3:26" />pien wun ducu dong wudoko lutino pa Lubanga pi niye Yecu Kricito. <verse eid="GAL 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GAL 3:27" />Wun jo ducu madong kityeko batijawu inying Kricito dong wuruku Kricito macalo wuruku bongowu. <verse eid="GAL 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GAL 3:28" />Apokapoka mo dong pe ikin Lajudaya ki dano me Grik, ikin opii ki ngat ma lone kene, kadi ikin laco ki dako, pien wun ducu dong wurom i Kricito Yecu. <verse eid="GAL 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GAL 3:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 4:13">Rom 4:13</ref> </char></note> Ka wun dong wulwak pa Kricito, ci dong wun likwayo pa Abraim; dok pi cike pa Lubanga, wun lule gin mayam en ociko bot Abraim.<verse eid="GAL 3:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="GAL 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 4:1" />Kombedi dong waco kit man ni, laleyo ka pud latin bedo rom ki opii, kadi bed en won jami ducu. <verse eid="GAL 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 4:2" />En kong bedo ite loc pa jo ma gwoke ki jo ma gwoko jamine, nio ka kare ma wone ociko oromo. <verse eid="GAL 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 4:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 2:8">Kol 2:8</ref> </char></note> Wan bene watye kitmeno; ikare ma wan pud lutino, yam wabedo opii pa jogi ma gitye kaloc iwi loboni. <verse eid="GAL 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 4:4" />Ento ma kare kikome ma kicikoni dong oromo, ci Lubanga ocwalo Wode ma dako onywalo, kun kinywalo ite Cik, <verse eid="GAL 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 4:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 8:15-17">Rom 8:15-17</ref> </char></note> wek okok jo mayam tye ite loc me Cik, ka wek wan bene kilokwa wadok lutino me paco. <verse eid="GAL 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 4:6" />Kit macalo wun dong lutino me paco, en aye ma omiyo Lubanga ocwalo Cwiny pa wode i iwa ma weko walwongo Lubanga ni, “Abba! Wora!” <verse eid="GAL 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 4:7" />Kitmeno, pi tic pa Lubanga omiyo in dong pe opii, ento latin me paco; ka dong in latin me paco, man nyutu ni in dong lale jami.<verse eid="GAL 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Paulo oparo pi jo Galatia matek</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 4:8" />Ikare macon ma onongo peya wungeyo Lubanga, onongo wubedo opii pa gin mogo atata ma i adane gin pe lubanga wa ki acel. <verse eid="GAL 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 4:9" />Ento kombedi dong wungeyo Lubanga, nyo kong awac ni, Lubanga dong ngeyowu; ci dok wutwero dok cen ningning bot jogi macon ma gigoro, ma piny bene oloyogi wokoni? Pingo dok wumito bedo opiigi pi tyen me aryo? <verse eid="GAL 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 4:10" />Wuketo cwinywu me gwoko nino, ki dwe, ki kare mapatpat, ki mwakagu! <verse eid="GAL 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 4:11" />Atye ki lworo matek, pien tica ma ayele kwede botwu kara aneko iye koma nono.<verse eid="GAL 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 4:12" />Utmegina, alegowu ni wubed calo an, pien an bene dong adoko calo wun. Wun giwu yam pe wutimo gin mo marac ikoma. <verse eid="GAL 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 4:13" />Wungeyo ni, pi koma ma onongo obedo lit omiyo atitiwu lok me Kwena Maber pi tyen mukwongo. <verse eid="GAL 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 4:14" />Yam pe wungala dok pe wucaya, kadi bed koma ma liti okelo botwu aoma cwiny, ento wujola maber calo wujolo lamalaika pa Lubanga, dok calo wujolo Kricito Yecu kikome. <verse eid="GAL 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 4:15" />Gin ango dok ma ongole i yomcwiny ma onongo wubedo kwedeni? An cadenwu ma aloko ni, kace nene twere, kono wukolo wangwu woko ci wumiyogi bota. <verse eid="GAL 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 4:16" />An mono aloke adoko lamerokwu pi tito botwu lok me ada?<verse eid="GAL 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 4:17" />Jo mukene ca gibwolo wangwu nono, tamgi rac. Gimito cego wiwu woko, wek wucak dworogi. <verse eid="GAL 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 4:18" />Dwore pi gin maber ber kare ducu, pe ka an atye botwu keken. <verse eid="GAL 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 4:19" />Lutinona, pud dok atye kaciro arem pirwu macalo dako ciro arem ikare me nywal, nio ka kit pa Kricito ocwene i iwu. <verse eid="GAL 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 4:20" />Onongo amito ni kong bed kwedwu kombedi, ka wek aniang kit gin ma myero alok botwu ki kunu, pien atye kaparo pirwu mada.<verse eid="GAL 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Carolok ikom Agar ki Cara</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 4:21" />Kong dong wutita mono wun jo ma wumito ni Cik olowu, wun pe wuwinyo gin ma Cik waco? <verse eid="GAL 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 4:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:22: a </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 16:15">Aca 16:15</ref>; </char><char style="xo" closed="false">b </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 21:2">Aca 21:2</ref> </char></note> Pien yam kicoyo ni, Abraim onongo tye ki awobe aryo, acel obedo wod pa angeca, ki acel obedo wod pa dakone kikome. <verse eid="GAL 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 4:23" />Ento wod pa angecani yam kinywalo ikit me kom, ki latin pa dako kikomeni kinywalo pi cike mayam Lubanga ociko. <verse eid="GAL 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 4:24" />Man ma awaconi obedo carolok. Mon aryo magi nyutu gicike aryo bene. Ngat acel oa ki iwi got Cinai, lutino ma en onywalo gubedo opii; dako meno en aye Agar. <verse eid="GAL 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GAL 4:25" />Kombedi Agar nyutu got Cinai, matye i Arabia; rom ki Jerucalem me kareni, pien en tye i opii kacel ki lutinone. <verse eid="GAL 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GAL 4:26" />Ento Jerucalem matye i polo lone kene, en aye obedo minwa. <verse eid="GAL 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GAL 4:27" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 54:1">Ica 54:1</ref> </char></note> Pien yam kicoyo ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GAL 4:27">“Bed ki yomcwiny, in dako ma lalur mayam pe inywalo latin mo ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GAL 4:27">mwoc ki wer kun idange matek in dako ma pud peya yam arem ogoyi!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GAL 4:27">Pien lutino pa dako ma kitenyo pol,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GAL 4:27">kato lutino pa dako ma bedo gin ki cware kacel.”<verse eid="GAL 4:27" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GAL 4:28" />Utmegina, wan wacal ki Icaka, wan lutino me cike pa Lubanga. <verse eid="GAL 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GAL 4:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 21:9">Aca 21:9</ref> </char></note> Ento macalo ikare ca onongo latin ma kinywalo ikit me kom obedo kaunu latin ma kinywalo pi Cwiny pa Lubanga, ikareni bene tye kitmeno. <verse eid="GAL 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GAL 4:30" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:30: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 21:10">Aca 21:10</ref> </char></note> Ento ginacoya kono waco ni ngo? Waco ni, “Ryem angecani woko gin ki wode, pien wod pa angeca pe bileyo jami kacel gin ki wod pa dako kikome.” <verse eid="GAL 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GAL 4:31" />Kitmeno, utmega, wan pe lutino pa angeca, ento wan lutino pa dako kikome.<verse eid="GAL 4:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="GAL 5" />
  <para style="s1">Wucung matek ikom kuc me lone kenwu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 5:1" />Kricito dong otyeko gonyowa woko ki i opii wek wabed jo ma kigonyo. Wucung dong matek; pe dok wuye rwako tyenwu i okol me opii.<verse eid="GAL 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 5:2" />Wuwiny ba, an Paulo kombedi awaciwu ni, ka kilirowu, ci teloke ni kony pa Kricito dong peke botwu. <verse eid="GAL 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 5:3" />Anwoyo loka dok bot dano acel acel ma kiliro ni, en dong tye ki banya me lubu Cik ducu. <verse eid="GAL 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 5:4" />Wun jo ma wumito ni kikwanwu ni kitwu atir pi lubu Cik, wun dong wupoke woko kenwu ki bot Kricito; dong wunyiko woko cen, wubwoto kica pa Lubanga. <verse eid="GAL 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 5:5" />Watye ki gen madwong pi Cwiny Maleng me nongo kit ma atir ma kimiyo pi niye. <verse eid="GAL 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 5:6" />Pien i Kricito lire nyo bedo ma pe kilire ducu konygi peke; niye keken aye konyo, ma tice aye mar.<verse eid="GAL 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 5:7" />Onongo nene wucako ringo ngwec maber; anga mono ma dok ogengowu i lubu lok me ada? <verse eid="GAL 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 5:8" />Abita macalo man pe oa ki bot ngat ma ceng olwongowuni. <verse eid="GAL 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 5:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 5:6">1 Kor 5:6</ref></char></note> Ka kitedo mugati, tobi matidi mo keken aye yenyo moko woko ducu. <verse eid="GAL 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 5:10" />Atye ki gen i Rwot ni, tamwu pe bipoke ki mera; ento ngat mo ni matye kabalo cwinywu wokoni, kadi bed en anga, Lubanga bingole kop. <verse eid="GAL 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 5:11" />Utmegina, pingo dok pud kiuna, ka an kikoma aye atito ni lire ber? Ka nene atito lok kumeno, kono pe tye gin mo ilok ikom yatariya ma obedo macalo ajut ma yoko dano. <verse eid="GAL 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 5:12" />Kono jo matye kabalo cwinywuni gumede anyim, gukole woko keken gi gigi!<verse eid="GAL 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 5:13" />Utmegina, yam kilwongowu me bedo agonya kun wulone kenwu; ento pe dok wulok bedo agonyawu odok me cobo mit ma kinywalowu kwede. Ma ka timo meno, myero dano acel acel omine me konyo luwote pi mar keken. <verse eid="GAL 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 5:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:18">Lev 19:18</ref></char></note> Pien Cik ducu kiribogi woko ilok acel keken ni, “Mar lawoti macalo imare keni.” <verse eid="GAL 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 5:15" />Ento ka wubedo ka kane kekenwu ki lakwu calo lee mager, kun wutimo dano wadiwu calo guci, myero wugwoke wek pe wutum woko kekenwu.<verse eid="GAL 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nyig me Cwiny ki tic me kit pa dano</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 5:16" />Ento awaciwu ni, wuye Cwiny Maleng pa Lubanga aye otelwu, wek pe wucob miti me kit pa dano. <verse eid="GAL 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 5:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 7:15-23">Rom 7:15-23</ref></char></note> Pien miti me kit pa dano pyem ki miti pa Cwiny Maleng, dok miti pa Cwiny Maleng bene pyem ki miti me kit pa dano. Gin aryoni gimon, meno aye gin ma gengowu tiyo gin ma wumito. <verse eid="GAL 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 5:18" />Ento ka Cwiny Maleng aye matye katelowu, ci dong pe wubedo ite Cik. <verse eid="GAL 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 5:19" />Tic me kit pa dano manen woko kamaleng gin en: tim kwele, caro, tarwang, <verse eid="GAL 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 5:20" />woro cal jogi, talo dano, mone, daa, nyeko, kiniga, laro dito, pyem, poke, <verse eid="GAL 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 5:21" />nek, mero ki kongo, cam me yomcwiny me mingo marac, ki mogo mukene macalo meno. Pud dok ajukuwu matek, kit macalo nene kong ajukuwu ni, jo ma timo gin macalo magi, ker pa Lubanga pe bibedo meggi.<verse eid="GAL 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 5:22" />Ento nyig me Cwiny Maleng gin aye mar, yomcwiny, kuc, diyo cwiny, kica, ber, gen, <verse eid="GAL 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 5:23" />mwolo, gwoke ken; Cik mo pe ma kwero gin macalo magi. <verse eid="GAL 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 5:24" />Dano ma gin jo pa Kricito Yecu dong gutyeko neko par ki miti me kit pa dano woko, ci gugurogi woko bene ikom yatariya.<verse eid="GAL 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GAL 5:25" />Ka wabedo kwo pi Cwiny Maleng, ci myero dong wawotu kun walubu en. <verse eid="GAL 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GAL 5:26" />Pe myero wabed kawake awaka, pe wanget cwiny luwotwa, dok pe myero wabed ki nyeko ikinwa kenwa.<verse eid="GAL 5:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="GAL 6" />
  <para style="s1">Konye wunu kenwu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 6:1" />Utmegina, kace kimako dano katimo bal mo, wun jo ma wutye ki Cwiny pa Lubanga wukonye wek odwoge i yo ma atir, kun wubedo kwede ki cwiny me mwolo. Kong ingiine kekeni, wek in bene pe kibiti. <verse eid="GAL 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 6:2" />Wuting peko pa luwotwu, meno aye bimiyo wucobo Cik pa Kricito. <verse eid="GAL 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 6:3" />Pien ka dano mo tamo i cwinye kene ni en e gin mo, kun i adane nongo en pe gin mo, nongo en bwole abwola kene. <verse eid="GAL 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 6:4" />Dano acel acel kong ongii tice kene ka ber, meno miyo tyen lok me wakene bedo pi tice kikome ma en otiyo, ma pe dok poro ki tic pa lawote. <verse eid="GAL 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 6:5" />Pien dano acel acel tye ki yece ma omyero oting.<verse eid="GAL 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 6:6" />Dano ma kitye kapwonyo ki lok ikom Kricito myero onywak jami ducu mabeco ma en tye kwede ki ngat ma pwonye.<verse eid="GAL 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 6:7" />Pe wuwek kibwolwu; Lubanga pe gituku kwede. Gin ma dano ocoyo, en aye bene en bikayo. <verse eid="GAL 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 6:8" />Ngat ma ocoyo kodi i poto me kit pa dano, gin ma en bikayo ki iye en aye to; ento ngat ma coyo kodine i poto me Cwiny Maleng, bikayo mere kwo ma pe tum pi Cwiny Maleng. <verse eid="GAL 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 6:9" />Pe omyero waol katiyo gin maber, pien ka kare oromo, ka cwinywa pe odoko nyap, ci wabikayo kac. <verse eid="GAL 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 6:10" />Dong kit macalo pud watye ki kareni, myero watiyu gin maber bot dano ducu, makato ducu myero watiyu bot utmegiwa ma guye Kricito.<verse eid="GAL 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Miyo tam me agiki ki mot</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 6:11" />Kong dong wunen kit nukuta madongo ma atye kacoyone ki cingani. <verse eid="GAL 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 6:12" />Jo matye kadiyowu ni myero wulireni, gin aye jo ma mito ni gin maber ma gitiyo onen ki woko. Tamgi tye ni pe myero kiungi pi yatariya pa Kricito. <verse eid="GAL 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 6:13" />Kadi jo ma kilirogini bene pe gimako Cik, ento gimito ni kilirwu ka wek giwake ikom lirewu. <verse eid="GAL 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 6:14" />Ento an pe amito awake pi gin mo, kono pi yatariya pa Rwotwa Yecu Kricito keken, pien ki tung bota lobo dong kiguro woko ikom yatariyane, ki tung bot lobo an kikoma bene dong kigura woko. <verse eid="GAL 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 6:15" />Pien bedo ma kilire nyo ma pe kilire lok mo pe iye; ento gin ma pire dit tutwal en aye me bedo ginacweya manyen. <verse eid="GAL 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 6:16" />Kuc ki kica obed ikom jo ma poro kwogi ki cik man, ki ikom jo pa Lubanga ducu.<verse eid="GAL 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 6:17" />Cake kombedi pe amito ngat mo oyela, pien atye ki poyo madong kiketo ikoma ma nyutu ni an opii pa Yecu.<verse eid="GAL 6:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 6:18" />Kica pa Rwotwa Yecu Kricito obed kwedwu, utmegina. Amen.<verse eid="GAL 6:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 6" />
</usx>